ecause the Lakers have many back-to-backs and he has a soft tissue history.","sources":["https://youtu.be/sFelMKWcqyI?t=2119"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"The Lakers should be in the seeding race, so there is no tanking. One game of rest in March is plausible given his calf and hamstring history.","sources":["https://youtu.be/sFelMKWcqyI?t=368"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}